      "body": "Times Green Energy (India) Limited announced that the Board of Directors the Company at their meeting held on January 20, 2026 and approved Cessation of Mrs. Padma Priyanka Vangala as the Non-Executive Independent Director with effect from October 21, 2025 upon completion of her current term. Appointment of Mr. Mahavir Kumar Jain as the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from January 20, 2026. Mr. Mahavir Kumar Jain is an Associate Member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI). With over 8 years of experience in legal and regulatory roles, he is a Company Secretary, bringing expertise in corporate governance and compliance. Mr. Mahavir Kumar Jain is not related to any Director of the Company.",
