      "body": "Times Green Energy (India) Limited announced that CS Abhishek Reddy Rachur has tendered his resignation as the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the company with effect from January 1, 2026. The resignation was accepted by the Board of Directors on January 3, 2026. The noting of resignation will be taken at the ensuing Board Meeting of the company and the appointment of subsequent Company Secretary and Compliance Officer shall be intimated to the Stock Exchange in due course of time. The resignation was submitted in order to pursue better career opportunities.",
